  <class_name>ApplyHvacTopologyToZoneScope</class_name>
  <display_name>Apply HVAC Topology To Zone Scope</display_name>
  <description>Runs one split HVAC topology measure on thermal-zone names resolved from the model at run time.</description>
  <modeler_description>zone_scope all_model_zones passes every thermal zone in the model, by exact name, to the selected topology measure; explicit_zone_names passes the exact names listed in zone_names_json. Create and replace keep the topology measure's own safety checks.</modeler_description>
